mor de los pobres.", "words": [[0, 76698], [7, 77373], [18, 78083], [21, 78223], [28, 78723], [31, 78843], [38, 79343], [41, 79483], [48, 80347], [51, 80476], [54, 80636], [61, 81136], [65, 81276], [72, 81796], [75, 81916], [79, 82036]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 83179, "end": 91989, "text": "Ten misericordia de mí, Jehová: mira mi aflicción que padezco de los que me aborrecen, tú que me levantas de las puertas de la muerte;", "words": [[0, 83179], [4, 83439], [17, 84259], [20, 84576], [24, 84892], [32, 85481], [37, 85790], [40, 86030], [50, 86750], [54, 86950], [62, 87630], [65, 87770], [69, 87890], [73, 88050], [76, 88690], [87, 89330], [90, 89730], [94, 89930], [97, 90050], [106, 90530], [109, 90610], [113, 90730], [121, 91130], [124, 91270], [127, 91370]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 92439, "end": 98692, "text": "Porque cuente yo todas tus alabanzas en las puertas de la hija de Sion, y me goce en tu salvación.", "words": [[0, 92439], [7, 92781], [14, 93161], [17, 93401], [23, 93781], [27, 94021], [37, 94781], [40, 94921], [44, 95061], [52, 95481], [55, 95641], [58, 95741], [63, 96041], [66, 96141], [72, 96541], [74, 97021], [77, 97161], [82, 97541], [85, 97661], [88, 97801]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 99142, "end": 105124, "text": "Se hundieron las naciones en la fosa que hicieron; en la red que escondieron fue tomado su pie.", "words": [[0, 99142], [3, 99377], [13, 99817], [17, 100017], [26, 100477], [29, 100717], [32, 100857], [37, 101177], [41, 101357], [51, 102495], [54, 102673], [57, 102873], [61, 103173], [65, 103413], [77, 103973], [81, 104193], [88, 104573], [91, 104713]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 105574, "end": 114465, "text": "Jehová fue conocido en el juicio que hizo; en la obra de sus manos fue enlazado el malo. (Higaion. Selah.)", "words": [[0, 105574], [7, 106272], [11, 106392], [20, 107072], [23, 107192], [26, 107332], [33, 107752], [37, 107992], [43, 108861], [46, 109008], [49, 109168], [54, 109448], [57, 109628], [61, 109788], [67, 110228], [71, 110808], [80, 111448], [83, 111568], [89, 112942], [99, 114146]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 114915, "end": 120425, "text": "Los malos serán trasladados al infierno, todas las gentes que se olvidan de Dios.", "words": [[0, 114915], [4, 115034], [10, 115514], [16, 115874], [28, 116654], [31, 116834], [41, 117834], [47, 118234], [51, 118634], [58, 119034], [62, 119114], [65, 119254], [73, 119714], [76, 119854]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 120875, "end": 127338, "text": "Porque no para siempre será olvidado el pobre; ni la esperanza de los pobres perecerá perpetuamente.", "words": [[0, 120875], [7, 121079], [10, 121299], [15, 121539], [23, 121839], [28, 122319], [37, 122999], [40, 123139], [47, 124132], [50, 124270], [53, 124430], [63, 124950], [66, 125090], [70, 125230], [77, 125590], [86, 126170]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 127788, "end": 134738, "text": "Levántate, oh Jehová; no se fortalezca el hombre; sean juzgadas las naciones delante de ti.", "words": [[0, 127788], [11, 128467], [14, 129145], [22, 130067], [25, 130195], [28, 130355], [39, 130975], [42, 131095], [50, 131873], [55, 132133], [64, 132833], [68, 133253], [77, 133793], [85, 134213], [88, 134353]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 135188, "end": 141443, "text": "Pon, oh Jehová, temor en ellos: conozcan las naciones que son no más que hombres. (Selah.)", "words": [[0, 135188], [5, 135490], [8, 135830], [16, 136170], [22, 136630], [25, 136790], [32, 138101], [41, 138191], [45, 138311], [54, 138731], [58, 138911], [62, 139164], [65, 139418], [69, 139671], [73, 139791], [82, 141095]]}]}